{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your son Courtney is a streamer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unbeknownst to him, you're the most active moderator in his chat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People are always popping in and leaving rude messages. As his doting father, your role is to protect him from their vitriol.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules of this game are simple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See a rude message in chat? Delete it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Someone asked something creepy? EZ ban.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chat is theorizing about his personal life? Blow them all up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you fail, Courtney might read their messages...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We wouldn't want that, would we?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique hand-drawn art and animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Renamable protagonist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About 3 hours of gameplay</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3811040?t=1757527877","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3811040?t=1757527877","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811040/98992f35f02dea4b490a7ace79f5fa4e2eb42855/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757527877","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811040/98992f35f02dea4b490a7ace79f5fa4e2eb42855/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757527877","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77}